export anchor IRCClassicStyle:
    number: 347
    screen: TeamChat
    name: IRC classic
    idea: A plain terminal chat client, where a topic line, a window list, a log with a fixed time and nick column, a nick list and a status bar do everything in one monospace face.
    base: dark
    palette:
        bg: #0c0c0c, the log and the style sheet
        bar: #1d1d2a, the title bar and the status bar
        topic: #00303d, the topic line
        sel: #103a4a, the current window row
        rule: #3a3a3a, pane dividers
        ink: #d0d0d0, message text
        dim: #9a9a9a, times, brackets and event lines
        white: #ffffff, active windows and the inverse focus block
        hi: #5fd7ff, links, the input prompt and section labels
        warn: #ffd75f, reactions, typing and activity
        mention: #ff87af, the mention window
        nick1: #d7afff, Priya's nick
        nick2: #87d787, Mara's nick and the send key
        nick3: #ffaf5f, Aiko's nick
        nick4: #87afff, Jonas's nick
    type:
        One monospace stack, ui-monospace, Cascadia Mono, DejaVu Sans Mono,
        Liberation Mono, Menlo, Consolas, at 14px with 1.5 leading, 13px
        under 720px. Bold only for active and mention windows and section
        heads at 20px.
    layout:
        Full width terminal. A one line title bar reads Brightwork Chat,
        mara on the left and the channel with 5 lines and 1 thread on the
        right. A teal topic line follows, Topic then a derived line about
        the hero options due Monday. Three panes, a 290px window list, the
        log and a 230px nick list, split by 1px rules. Windows are numbered
        1 to 8, channels then queries. The current one is on the sel band,
        mobile-release is bold white with (4 unread), billing-war-room is
        bold pink with [@1 mention]. The log is a grid with a 7ch time in
        brackets, a 16ch right aligned nick in angle brackets in that
        person's colour, then the text. A day change line starts it. Under
        Aiko's line an arrow row holds an underlined thread link with 3
        replies and yellow [+1 x3] and [eyes x1] tags. The image is an
        event line with a star, Priya sent an image and the filename as a
        link. The nick list marks people with plus for online, tilde for
        away and minus for offline plus the word. A status bar shows the
        time, mara, 2 and the channel, and an Act field naming window 3
        with 4 unread and window 4 with @1 mention. Then -- Priya is typing
        in yellow and an input line with the bracketed channel prompt, the
        field and bracketed attach, emoji and send words. Below 720px the
        panes stack, windows wrap inline and each log line wraps with a
        hanging indent.
    spacing: Character cells. 1ch gaps, a 12px pane gutter, one line per message.
    density: Dense. Fixed 7ch time and 16ch nick columns.
    corners: Square everywhere.
    borders: 1px #3a3a3a pane dividers. Bars are solid colour strips.
    shadows: None.
    icons: None. Text marks only, plus, tilde and minus for presence, an arrow for the thread and a star for events.
    focus: Inverse video, a white block with black text.
    tone: Terse client speak, such as Day changed, Act with window numbers, and -- Priya is typing.
